# UI design requirements

- Read and follow `docs/UI-DESIGN.md` before changing UI.
- Preserve every existing fact and feature across responsive layouts.
- Design from 320px up; mobile must support the complete workflow.
- Keep touch targets at least 44×44px and supporting text at least 12px.
- Never synthesize bold Hanzi. Use the existing `.han` class.
- Reuse `ui-card`, `ui-card-interactive`, `ui-eyebrow`, and `ui-touch`.
- Use `--app-header-height` for sticky content; never hardcode header offsets.
- Give wide tables and decomposition trees explicit overflow handling.
- Maintain keyboard semantics, focus visibility, reduced motion, and dark mode.
